sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/UI
    participant App as TokenManager (Python)
    participant Cache as .questrade_cache (Local)
    participant QAuth as Questrade Auth API

    User->>App: Request Data Update
    
    App->>Cache: Read Active Token
    alt Cache Missing/Invalid
        App->>User: Get "Seed" Token (Env)
    end

    App->>QAuth: POST /oauth2/token (Current Token)
    
    alt Success
        QAuth-->>App: New Access Token + New Refresh Token
        Note over App,Cache: Atomic Swap Process
        App->>Cache: Write NEW_REFRESH_TOKEN to .tmp
        App->>Cache: Rename .tmp to .questrade_cache
        App-->>User: Refresh Successful (Data Flow Starts)
    else Failure (Single-Use Violation/Expir)
        QAuth-->>App: 400 Bad Request
        App->>User: Trigger Setup Modal (Re-seed Required)
    end
